ask(1453,'one-hot-code','After fitting the source five-word encoder, what happens under its defaults if transform([["blue"]]) is requested?', ['It raises an unknown-category error rather than silently adding a sixth column','It appends blue as a sixth column and resizes all earlier rows automatically','It treats blue as red because both are color words','It converts the single input word into a five-token sentence before encoding'],['The default handle_unknown setting is error, and transform does not refit the vocabulary.','Adding a new category requires a different fit/configuration, not ordinary transform.','One-hot category matching is lexical, not semantic synonym or attribute matching.','The nested input is one sample with one categorical feature.'],kind='algorithm_trace',steps=['The fitted category list excludes blue.','The shown call leaves handle_unknown at its default error setting.','Transform therefore raises ValueError without learning a new column.'],cites=[(1453,'code','Fitted five-category OneHotEncoder call')],primary=[OHAPI])
